desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "python"
	title: "Struct scan: Python asyncio create_subprocess_shell"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python asyncio 子进程 shell"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-python-asyncio-shell"
	risk: "command-injection"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 create_subprocess_shell。通过 shell 执行，外部输入可注入。

### 风险类型
command-injection

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 create_subprocess_exec 和参数列表。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://a.py": <<<POS
import asyncio
async def r(c):
    return await asyncio.create_subprocess_shell(c)

POS
	"safefile://s.py": <<<NEG
def r(c):
    return c

NEG
)

create_subprocess_shell as $call
create_subprocess_shell(* as $c) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Python asyncio create_subprocess_shell",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python asyncio 子进程 shell",
	message: "结构扫描：Python asyncio 子进程 shell",
	risk: "command-injection",
}
